/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 311 Tm (an email or modifying a calendar requires explicit approval in the current conversation.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 292 Tm (This design gives the user speed without removing control. When automation is unavailable,) Tj
