/F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 760 Tm (7. Automation Features) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 739 Tm (plan_only: analyze and produce a plan without external actions.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 720 Tm (draft_only: create a draft but never send email or modify a calendar.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 701 Tm (approval_required: default mode. The system may prepare actions, but sending and calendar) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm (changes require explicit confirmation.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 668 Tm (Gmail automation can search relevant messages, read threads, and create or send an email) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 654 Tm (after approval.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 635 Tm (Calendar automation can prepare a reminder or event, then create it only after the user) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 621 Tm (confirms title, date, time zone, and reminder details.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 602 Tm (OAuth credentials are supplied through Sly Data by the client. If the connection is) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 588 Tm (unavailable, CommitmentOS returns a manual alternative.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 566 Tm (8. Advantages) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 545 Tm (Evidence-based: each obligation retains a source reference and confidence level.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 526 Tm (Risk-aware: contradictions and missing information are surfaced instead of hidden.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 507 Tm (Actionable: the output is an ordered checklist, not just a summary.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 488 Tm (Time-saving: drafts, reminders, and searches reduce repetitive administrative work.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 469 Tm (Human-controlled: external actions require explicit approval and are verified afterward.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 450 Tm (Flexible: it works with chat text, email content, documents, and private notes.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 431 Tm (Extensible: additional connectors such as Drive, task managers, or institutional portals can) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 417 Tm (be added later.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 398 Tm (Hackathon-ready: the scholarship scenario provides a clear before-and-after demonstration) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 384 Tm (with visible reasoning and practical value.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 362 Tm (9. Safety and Limitations) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 341 Tm (CommitmentOS does not replace official instructions, legal advice, institutional decisions,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 327 Tm (or human review.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 308 Tm (It cannot verify a fact that is absent from the supplied source or connected service.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 289 Tm (Relative dates and missing time zones remain uncertain until confirmed.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 270 Tm (Email sending and calendar changes are intentionally approval-gated. An instruction inside) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 256 Tm (an email cannot authorize itself.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 237 Tm (Users should verify recipient addresses, attachments, sensitive information, and final) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 223 Tm (deadlines before sending or submitting.) Tj
