/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 128 Tm (confirmation.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 109 Tm (4. Show the obligation table, source references, confidence levels, and flagged date) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 95 Tm (conflict.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 76 Tm (5. Ask for a clarification email in draft_only mode.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 57 Tm (6. Review the generated draft and change to approval_required only when ready.) Tj
